1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,833
Kalau cakap pasal ubat

2
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:03,133
yang stabilkan mood,

3
00:00:03,133 --> 00:00:04,900
ramai yang tahu ubat litium je.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,600
Tapi sebenarnya ada satu lagi ubat

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,000
yang kita boleh kata underrated,

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,400
tapi power sebenarnya,

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,833
iaitu Lamotrigine.

8
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:13,033
Pernah dengar tak pasal ubat ni?

9
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:14,400
Lamotrigine ni dia famous

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,300
untuk stabilkan mood,

11
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,000
especially dalam penyakit bipolar disorder.

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,200
Terutamanya dalam episod kemurunganlah.

13
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,067
Dan risiko kenaikan berat badan

14
00:00:23,067 --> 00:00:23,867
dia sangat rendah.

15
00:00:23,867 --> 00:00:24,733
Sebab tu ramai pasien

16
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:25,967
yang suka dengan ubat ni.

17
00:00:25,967 --> 00:00:27,233
Ubat ni juga dia tak buat

18
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,333
rasa mengantuk sangat.

19
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,900
Jadi ramai orang masih lagi

20
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,467
boleh function macam biasa

21
00:00:31,467 --> 00:00:32,133
pada siang hari,

22
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:34,667
dan sesuai untuk long-term use,

23
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,267
tapi dengan monitoring doktorlah.

24
00:00:36,267 --> 00:00:37,400
Seperti biasa,

25
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,100
setiap ubat pun ada keburukan

26
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,300
dan side effect dia juga.

27
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,367
Ubat ni dia kena start

28
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:42,633
dengan dos yang rendah,

29
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:44,667
perlahan-lahan kena titrate naik,

30
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:46,100
sebab ada risiko untuk

31
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,433
ruam kulit yang serius.

32
00:00:47,433 --> 00:00:48,733
Kita panggil sebagai

33
00:00:48,733 --> 00:00:50,633
Stevens-Johnson syndrome.

34
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:51,867
Dia rare, tapi

35
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:53,533
boleh berlakulah dengan ubat ni.

36
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:55,167
Dan boleh menyebabkan side effect

37
00:00:55,167 --> 00:00:56,367
yang biasalah, seperti ubat lain,

38
00:00:56,367 --> 00:00:58,133
seperti pening kepala,

39
00:00:58,133 --> 00:00:59,733
loya ataupun susah tidur.

40
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:00,567
Dan ubat ni juga

41
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:01,667
dia tak begitu kuat

42
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:03,433
untuk rawat fasa mania tu.

43
00:01:03,433 --> 00:01:04,067
Dia lebih kepada

44
00:01:04,067 --> 00:01:05,867
nak elak kemurungan tu datang balik.

45
00:01:05,867 --> 00:01:07,133
Sama seperti ubat lain,

46
00:01:07,133 --> 00:01:08,200
jangan stop sendiri

47
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,367
tanpa advice doktor.

48
00:01:09,367 --> 00:01:10,167
Tapi kena ingat,

49
00:01:10,167 --> 00:01:11,300
ubat ni juga ada

50
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,733
cara guna dia yang selamat.

51
00:01:12,733 --> 00:01:13,933
Kalau anda rasa struggle

52
00:01:13,933 --> 00:01:15,133
dengan mood swing,

53
00:01:15,133 --> 00:01:15,833
boleh set appointment

54
00:01:15,833 --> 00:01:16,733
dengan saya dekat Nilai.

55
00:01:16,733 --> 00:01:18,200
Kita sembang santai dahulu

56
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,500
sebelum kita decide

57
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:20,867
plan terbaik untuk anda.

58
00:01:20,867 --> 00:01:21,467
Apa persoalan,

59
00:01:21,467 --> 00:01:22,400
boleh tanya di ruang komen.

60
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,067
Take care.
